  "summary": "I’m a Lead Software Engineer with 6+ years of experience designing, building, and scaling distributed, cloud-native platforms. At Capital One, I’ve led projects that combine technical depth with cross-functional collaboration—delivering secure, high-performance systems that serve millions of users. My expertise spans modern web technologies and cloud architectures, with a strong focus on creating scalable platforms and empowering engineering teams to deliver at speed.\n\nBeyond writing clean, maintainable code, I thrive on driving technical strategy, mentoring engineers, and translating complex business needs into innovative solutions. I’m passionate about working in forward-leaning environments—whether that’s at high-growth startups or established tech leaders—where I can contribute to modern stacks, cutting-edge practices, and products that make an impact.\n\nI’m driven by opportunities to work with modern technology ecosystems, contribute to meaningful products, and maintain a healthy work-life balance. Whether building greenfield products, leading engineering teams, or driving technical innovation, I bring a balance of strategic vision and hands-on execution.",
